**Quick Cheatsheet Summary:**

• **Context upfront:** Always follow Context -> Problem -> Solution.
• **Face-to-face:** Preferred for feedback; focus on impact.
• **Support the bugs:** Echo back, tag urgency, and protect energy.
• **Respect focus time:** Pre-notify check-ins and explain rejections.
:::

